5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I hope we can find a way to expand our services that brings joy to everyone in our community.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I believe we should be mindful of who we are serving and whether our new efforts truly reach those who need them most.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm so excited! I want to make sure we don't just guess what's good, but actually look at what happened before so we can do it better!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most spirited start, Rin. I suspect the devil is in the details of the funding, so I shall be looking for the structural cracks in our budget.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We must be practical. A great idea is useless if we don't have the specific skills on our staff to actually run it day-to-day.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, you have a point about reach. I wonder if the weather or the roads affect our neighbors more than we realize during the winter months.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that is a very thoughtful observation. I also want to see how the current transport links are affecting the people in the outer wards.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to look at the old programs! I bet there are secrets in the records from years ago that could help us now.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, while skills are vital, the shape of the money often dictates the survival of the project. I'll be examining the grant terms and the endowment.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I don't disagree, but I will be checking the volunteer register and the training records to see who is actually available to help.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think it would be wise to see the attendance sheets from our old outreach stops to see where people actually gathered.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I will also look into the evening room bookings to see if our current hours are a barrier for some.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'll check the attendance sheets too! I want to see if the kids in the outer wards actually liked the old stops.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall also examine the running and equipment lines from last year to see where the money actually vanished.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look into the neighbourhood associations and tool certification to see if we have the technical expertise we think we do.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
