60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The candidates are a Mobile Branch, a Maker Workshop, Language Circles, and a Digital Archive. I feel the Mobile Branch is the kindest choice.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The Mobile Branch directly addresses the bus link failures and the isolation of the outer wards. It is the most equitable option.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I like the Maker Workshop, but the Digital Archive sounds like that old project that failed! Let's go with the Mobile Branch!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The Mobile Branch is a financial risk given the vehicle overruns, but the Digital Archive is a ghost of failures past. I lean toward the Mobile Branch.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,The Maker Workshop is impossible without a certified technician. Language Circles need supervisors we don't have. The Mobile Branch is the most viable.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, if we use the endowment for the vehicle, perhaps the budget will be more stable for the second year?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that would be a wise use of resources to ensure the outer wards aren't forgotten again.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,I'm just glad we aren't doing the archive thing! Let's make sure the mobile bus has lots of cool books!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shizue, the endowment is for capital items, so a vehicle fits. It solves the funding shape problem I was worried about.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree. While it adds to the workload, it is the only proposal that doesn't require a specialized certification we currently lack.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am very happy we have found a path that reaches everyone. I am ready to vote for the Mobile Branch Service.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I concur. It is the only choice that corrects the geographic imbalance of our current system. I vote for the Mobile Branch Service.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,Me too! Let's go with the bus! I vote for the Mobile Branch Service!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The logic is sound, and the funding path is clear via the endowment. I vote for the Mobile Branch Service.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,It is the most realistic option given our current staffing and certification gaps. I vote for the Mobile Branch Service.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
